(7681156, 1256701, 97225, '<td valign="top">That piece is a substantial accomplishment! I like the way the subject pops against the black.<br/> <br/>Probably the most irrelevant comment you are ever going to get but your title brought back a memory of 10 year-old me bringing home her school maths work for my parents to see (and fume over). Diagonally written in large capitals across my page of meager long division ''THIS REPRESENTS ONE WHOLE MORNING''S WORK!'' (I hid it in my cupboard but that didn''t save me.)</td>', 'That piece is a substantial accomplishment! I like the way the subject pops against the black. Probably the most irrelevant comment you are ever going to get but your title brought back a memory of 10 year-old me bringing home her school maths work for my parents to see (and fume over). Diagonally written in large capitals across my page of meager long division ''THIS REPRESENTS ONE WHOLE MORNING''S WORK!'' (I hid it in my cupboard but that didn''t save me.)', '2020-12-07 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
